  "name": "Shield of the Faithful",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You always have the Shield of Faith spell prepared.</p><p>You can cast it without Concentration and without expending a spell slot. You can do so a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier and regain all expended uses on Long Rest. You can also restore a use by expending a level 2+ spell slot (no action required).</p>",
